<view class="page">
  <view class="intro card"><view class="intro-title">售后申诉与消息</view><view class="intro-desc">只要美客多返回可回复线程就会显示，与订单是否退款无关。</view></view>
  <view wx:if="{{errors.length}}" class="error-box"><view wx:for="{{errors}}" wx:key="*this">{{item}}</view></view>
  <view wx:if="{{loading && !claims.length}}" class="empty">正在检查所有授权店铺的售后线程…</view>
  <view wx:elif="{{!loading && !claims.length}}" class="empty">当前没有美客多返回的可回复售后申诉</view>
  <view wx:for="{{claims}}" wx:key="key" class="card claim" data-key="{{item.key}}" bindtap="openThread">
    <view class="head"><text class="status">待处理售后</text><text>{{item.countryText}}</text><text class="order">{{item.orderNo}}</text></view>
    <view class="store">{{item.storeName}} · 买家 {{item.buyer}}</view>
    <view class="product"><image class="image" mode="aspectFit" src="{{item.productImage}}" /><view class="product-main"><view class="title">{{item.productTitle}}</view><view class="reason">{{item.reasonText}}</view><view class="time">更新：{{item.dateText}}</view></view></view>
    <view class="open">打开售后会话并回复 ›</view>
  </view>
</view>
